        "raw": "<p>Yes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Okay, I&#39;m kidding. &nbsp;But seriously, there are several discrepancies in their bios. &nbsp;Names are different, birthplace is different, eyecolor is different.</p><p>Most damning of all, they have different skin tones. &nbsp;Eye color changes are common. &nbsp;Names can be changed. &nbsp;Birthplace can be a matter of perspective if something &quot;made me a new man&quot;. &nbsp;But a skin-color change from one natural shade to another? &nbsp;When was the last time you saw that happen?</p>",
